# Wave T43 (Coalseam kit): fossilskull — the museum's RAMOSAUR skull on a low stone plinth at the Coalseam Museum's east shoulder: bone-white cranium in profile, hollow eye, and the grin APPRENTICE RUE polishes every morning carried in a row of teeth. It stands beside the backend's own fossildisplay cells at the east rim. Fully opaque — the town grass is baked in (measured #1c7c0c from the shipped render). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T43-COALSEAM-PLAN.md §5.)
